{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026hjTCQcbF4r1792990482.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產西半山蔚然分行副區域營業董事簡英譓表示，分行新近促成西半山輝煌臺買賣成交，單位為高層F室，實用面積355平方呎，採2房間隔，向東北，望城市景，最新以720萬元成交，折合實用呎價20,282元。</p><p><br/>據了解，新買家為用家，心儀上址鄰近半山扶手電梯，出入便利，認為價格合適遂決定購入自用。原業主於2010年以415萬元購入單位，持貨16年，是次沽出賬面獲利305萬元，單位升值73%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:22:19.900279+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T06:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T10:38:20.501801+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T07:18:24.651031+00:00","content_hash":"8742316fd8dfecc0f9914869b134029060f4ee51301c989aeae41ce6df06eb4d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:22:19.900279+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}